```

Run it with `npx playwright test tests/practice-login.spec.ts --project=chromium`:

```ts
// Result with the correct password: 1 passed
//
// Result with a wrong password, and the error it showed:
//   1 failed. The error said that expect(page).toHaveURL failed:
//   the expected pattern was /dashboard/, and the received address
//   was the login page.
```

**Why this problem matters.** A test that you have never seen fail may not be checking anything. Changing the password proves that your assertions notice when the sign-in does not work.

